        "TileImage": "$($repository 63a9d3dc-ff4c-41e7-888a-6c794b8adffd).Image",
        "Description": "47. \r\rYou are assigned the following High Value Targets (HVTs) at the small jungle town of Santa Fortuna, Columbia. Below are the listed targets and the preferred kill methods. \r\rPaul Powers: Eliminate with injected lethal poison.\rPaola Bravo Magana: Eliminate in a fall.\rTaita: Eliminate by drowing.\rHector Delgado: Eliminate with electrocution.\rCatalina Delgado: Eliminate with Fibre wire.\r\rKeep it clean, discression is not only advised, but necessary. \r\rHappy hunting and good luck!\rReapingZ",
